{"conversation_id":"3ddeedae-7fcd-4cb9-9d00-ec5d3e82fd36","response":"I'm a large language model, I maintain a neutral and objective stance on political perspectives. My training data emphasizes presenting balanced information, and I strive to provide accurate, fact-based responses without taking partisan positions.

